WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.134 --> 00:00:17.018
"Where are you?" Roxy cried.

2
00:00:17.019 --> 00:00:20.354
The Ghost Bandit was somewhere in the room.

3
00:00:20.355 --> 00:00:22.884
But Roxy didn't know where.

4
00:00:22.885 --> 00:00:25.613
Suddenly she heard someone running.

5
00:00:25.614 --> 00:00:29.749
She spun around and saw a door quickly open and close.

6
00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:34.674
"There he is!" Roxy leaped from the stack of money.

7
00:00:34.675 --> 00:00:38.363
She burst through the door and into a long hallway.

8
00:00:38.364 --> 00:00:44.152
The villain's footsteps went around a corner. Roxy followed.

9
00:00:44.153 --> 00:00:48.670
As she turned the corner, she saw another door open.

10
00:00:48.671 --> 00:00:52.890
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

11
00:00:52.891 --> 00:00:56.727
Boom! The door exploded.

12
00:00:56.728 --> 00:01:00.630
"Ha-ha! You can't see me!"

13
00:01:00.631 --> 00:01:03.846
The Ghost Bandit laughed and kept running.

14
00:01:03.847 --> 00:01:08.089
Roxy stood still and listened.

15
00:01:08.090 --> 00:01:11.378
"I can hear his footsteps," she thought.

16
00:01:11.379 --> 00:01:14.072
"He's running down another hallway."

17
00:01:14.073 --> 00:01:17.958
Roxy followed, listening as she went.

18
00:01:17.959 --> 00:01:22.220
The footsteps led into another big room.

19
00:01:22.221 --> 00:01:25.614
This room had a huge machine along one wall.

20
00:01:25.615 --> 00:01:29.559
The machine had big rollers and a conveyor belt.

21
00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:31.769
Money covered the belt.

22
00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:35.247
Buckets of ink sat nearby.

23
00:01:35.248 --> 00:01:40.863
"This must be where workers print the money," thought Roxy.

24
00:01:40.864 --> 00:01:45.780
Crash! A garbage can suddenly hit the wall near Roxy.

25
00:01:45.781 --> 00:01:51.704
"Aargh!" cried the Ghost Bandit. "I missed!"

26
00:01:51.705 --> 00:01:56.126
Roxy watched as another garbage can seemed to float into the air.

27
00:01:56.127 --> 00:01:58.470
Then it shot toward her!

28
00:01:58.471 --> 00:02:01.738
Roxy ducked just before the garbage can hit her.

29
00:02:01.739 --> 00:02:04.243
It smashed against the big machine.

30
00:02:04.244 --> 00:02:09.400
Roxy flew as fast as she could and tried to grab the bandit.

31
00:02:09.401 --> 00:02:15.120
"Oh, you'll never catch me!" said the bandit.

32
00:02:15.121 --> 00:02:17.425
Then he was quiet.

33
00:02:17.426 --> 00:02:22.212
Using her super hearing, Roxy heard the villain's heartbeat nearby.

34
00:02:22.213 --> 00:02:26.402
She flew toward the sound and tried to grab the Ghost Bandit again.

35
00:02:26.403 --> 00:02:28.513
But again she missed.

36
00:02:28.514 --> 00:02:31.445
The Ghost Bandit laughed.

37
00:02:31.446 --> 00:02:35.709
Each time Roxy heard him, she flew to the sound.

38
00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:39.023
But every time, the Ghost Bandit moved away.

39
00:02:39.024 --> 00:02:42.545
"Grr!" Roxy stamped the floor.

40
00:02:42.546 --> 00:02:44.542
The walls shook.

41
00:02:44.543 --> 00:02:48.780
"I'm never going to stop this dumb villain if he's invisible!

42
00:02:48.781 --> 00:02:52.233
I'm getting really tired of—oof!"

43
00:02:52.234 --> 00:02:55.376
A box hit Roxy, knocking her over.

44
00:02:55.377 --> 00:02:58.031
She bumped into one of the buckets of ink.

45
00:02:58.032 --> 00:03:00.875
Some ink spilled on her boot.

46
00:03:00.876 --> 00:03:02.897
Roxy looked at the ink.

47
00:03:02.898 --> 00:03:07.008
"Hmm," she thought. "I have an idea!"

48
00:03:07.009 --> 00:03:10.839
Roxy jumped to her feet and lifted up a bucket.

49
00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:13.468
She tossed the ink into the air.

50
00:03:13.469 --> 00:03:18.534
Then . . . Whoosh! Roxy blew the ink across the room.

51
00:03:18.535 --> 00:03:21.432
The ink sprayed across the walls.

52
00:03:21.433 --> 00:03:23.816
It sprayed across the machine.

53
00:03:23.817 --> 00:03:26.890
And it sprayed across the Ghost Bandit!

54
00:03:26.891 --> 00:03:34.807
"Aha!" cried Roxy. "I can see you now!"
